+"""
+Controlled Integration Validation Tests for MediaProof Phase 1.
+
+Covers:
+1. Identical media compared with itself (temporal match, zero metadata drift).
+2. Benign re-encode / transcode (temporal match, metadata drift detected).
+3. Prefix or suffix trimming (temporal alignment of overlap, metadata duration delta).
+4. Internal segment removed or spliced (temporal gap, metadata duration delta).
+5. Reordered segments (temporal sequence disruption, metadata duration parity).
+6. Changed technical metadata (dimensions/codec, dHash scale-invariance).
+7. Missing or jointly unavailable metadata fields (STATUS_SUCCESS_WITH_MISSING_FIELDS, is_drift=False).
+8. Corrupt media, decoder failure, or missing tool handling (graceful error states).
+9. Repeated execution with identical inputs (bit-for-bit determinism).
+10. Database persistence and retrieval with an isolated sandbox database.
+"""
